lPLd1aJQWAQ7kNvwGy4GV1&_nc_oc=AdrR-1AGaXIPGdeIRQ434hzz9uArJOcNFJLVc-cLbpNtKO3R108xcwcyXI4DhLKPBNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3oSBM7khqbrIwtHa-rDso0vToMVqvlOJMLmJCRPERJCA&oe=69D7A1C2"}, "display_name": "Sherlock Holmes: The Master Detective", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A Secret Society Is Watching. Can You See What Others Don\u2019t?\nStep into the mind of Sherlock Holmes and unravel a conspiracy hiding behind a string of brutal murders. A secret society operates in the shadows \u2014 and you\u2019re the only one who can expose it.\nExplore richly detailed hidden object scenes across foggy docks, lavish mansions, and secret ritual chambers. Each case draws you deeper into a world of deception, where every object could be a clue.\nBuilt from the ground up for VR, this is a fresh take on hidden object gameplay:\nUse ray-based precision to search for clues\nSwitch between word hints, image clues, and grouped items\nUse hints when you need a nudge\nWith Holmes\u2019s legendary tools \u2014 magnifying glass, fingerprint scanner, and chemical analyzer \u2014 you\u2019ll inspect evidence, solve puzzles, and outsmart suspects.\nFully voiced suspects with branching dialogues\nEngaging case design with unique locations and casts\nDesigned for comfort \u2014 seated or room-scale play\nCan you solve what others can\u2019t see?\n", "short_description": "A Secret Society Is Watching. Can You See What Others Don\u2019t?\nStep into the mind of Sherlock Holmes and unravel a mystery woven through murder, deception, and a secret society hiding in plain sight. Each case pulls you deeper into a conspiracy behind a string of murders \u2014 all connected by a hidden force operating in the shadows.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mess-works.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://mess-works.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Messworks", "support_website_url": null, "website_u